{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫小生朱敏瀚（朱仔）日前在為台慶進行綵排時發生意外，他當時不慎從兩米高的支架連人帶架摔落地面，情況一度令人擔心。</p><p>所幸經過幾日的休息與休養，朱仔的身體狀況已無大礙，迅速恢復狀態，展示出驚人的康復速度！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:42:34.585533+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T05:09:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T05:38:43.351281+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T05:38:43.351281+00:00","content_hash":"b442d3cfc4b85dcd1342cacccdf6d99d95afa5250eb9d482079a8c159f86a7d7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}